 "description": "<p>Narsaq or Narssaq is a town in the Kujalleq municipality in southern Greenland. The name Narsaq is Kalaallisut for &quot;Plain&quot;, referring to the beautiful shore of Tunulliarfik Fjord where the town is located. Source: <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Narsaq\" target=\"_blank\">Wikipedia</a></p><p>For further information (in Danish) see also the Danish Geodata Agency:&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.gronlandskehavnelods.dk/#HID=16\" target=\"_blank\">Den grønlandske Havnelods</a></p>",
